<title>ITALY: IMI group net profit up 20pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>IMI group net profit up 20pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ending December 31</p>
<p>(In billion lire unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit	   660.5 vs   551.8</p>
<p>    Financial activity    72,000   vs (up 17.4 pct)</p>
<p>    Net assets		 8,000   vs 7,795</p>
<p>    Total loans	     52,341   vs (little changed)</p>
<p>    Return on equity (ROE)   8.4%  vs 7.2%</p>
<p>Note: - Istituto Mobiliare Italiano Spa has already proposed a 550 lire per share dividend.</p>
</text>
